msgid ""
"POSIX.1-2001, POSIX.1-2008, 4.4BSD.  B<socketpair>()  first appeared in "
"4.2BSD.  It is generally portable to/from non-BSD systems supporting clones "
"of the BSD socket layer (including System\\ V variants)."
msgstr ""
"POSIX.1-2001, POSIX.1-2008, 4.4BSD. La fonction B<socketpair>() est apparue "
"dans BSD\\ 4.2. Elle est généralement portable de/vers les systèmes non-BSD "
"prenant en charge les clones des sockets BSD (y compris les variantes de "
"System V)."

